# The default data directory (OPENMIRROR_DATA_DIR). Holds the memory database,
# rewind checkpoints, generated media and the saved browser choice — one
# person's data, none of it the project's. It was not listed here until an
# install actually ran from the repo root and left it untracked in `git
# status`, which is one `git add -A` away from publishing a memory store.
data/
